{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qGuOFombzw1795216735.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美元匯價連升8日後回軟，收市微跌。</p><p></p><p>反映美元兌六隻主要貨幣的美匯指數，收市報103.84，跌百分之0.05。全個星期計則升百分之0.4。今個月以來，更錄得百分之1.9升幅。</p><p></p><p>美國聯儲局加息預期升溫，推動美元匯價月內上升，但美股急挫，加上美國10年期債息回軟，就令美元匯價單日下跌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:03:51.754065+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T23:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T14:30:50.831520+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:57:15.300267+00:00","content_hash":"caff039be52fea61bfbf3fcc8232aedc0201c9efb01c7b317ec3982f66ad54ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:03:51.754065+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}